{
  "short_id": "short302",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-076-morandi",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.283,
  "total_seconds": 54.02,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-076-morandi\\06_voice\\master\\short302_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "This is a story about a shell of concrete, a printed form, and a document that was owed by law and never written.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.827,
      "seconds": 6.827,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:066a54b8005e3ed208a1154d900cd05ae007e6a612b942154d44c33def7c1ab1"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "In 2003 Italy issued an order requiring the owners of strategic structures to carry out a formal assessment of their safety.",
      "start": 7.047,
      "end": 14.199,
      "seconds": 7.152,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6c34779e7f7ddaf0b318b507d90f13374964aba39fef6c9cf1f7b2adebd54edc"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "For the Polcevera viaduct, the deadline was March 2013.",
      "start": 14.419,
      "end": 17.763,
      "seconds": 3.344,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:9be153c4447c49e2b397d0baa5771a22f5c42c5bd1837dca4f651ad7deab359b"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "In July 2014 the ministry asked where they had got to. The company replied that the assessments were about to be completed.",
      "start": 17.983,
      "end": 24.763,
      "seconds": 6.78,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6356ab9add69d6705cd2b161bc47a68bd67c0b2e9e637fb8c5638f1cf48342c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "On the twenty-third of June 2017, in a numbered letter to the ministry, the company stated that for the Polcevera viaduct the assessment had been carried out.",
      "start": 24.983,
      "end": 33.853,
      "seconds": 8.87,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:3c2cddd9a92ca950b76e602f6b8e8d64a8514537934ec586d0a6e1039e66ba98"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "In the documents requested and obtained by this Commission, that assessment had not, at the date of delivery of the present report, in fact been carried out.",
      "start": 34.073,
      "end": 42.339,
      "seconds": 8.266,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:eeb4087ecde8045f7c2093d809fe5ae73d7ac7eaef0d445e75b73fa7faae98e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "From that assessment would have come the best possible estimate of structural safety against the risk of collapse.",
      "start": 42.559,
      "end": 48.085,
      "seconds": 5.526,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:109f94be0530a1c2c58b94b93ac1d7587f7b21a9b63b3767b84304be73284c4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "For the Polcevera viaduct, no safety analysis and no seismic assessment of the viaduct was ever made.",
      "start": 48.305,
      "end": 54.017,
      "seconds": 5.712,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b20cdff129584fa84409050a9d2e86fcafe0f5146f1d31a7b56a1a1a140841d1"
    }
  ]
}
